As a professor looking for people who might be

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:32.350
Good fit his words in the CIA's culture. And so just before I graduated

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:37.710
I was recruited into the CIA. I went through the security process and

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:44.030
Then started working for the CIA full-time on January the 7th 1990 and

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:48.630
My first the first half of my career for seven and a half years

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:52.750
I was an analyst working on Iraq and the second half of my career

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.750
I was a counterterrorism

00:03:55.510 --> 00:04:03.030
Operations officer working at first it's kind of quaint now, but at first against European communist

