Yes, and I think in one of the

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:22.390
Interviews that I saw you were one of the rare individuals if not the only person who spoke Greek and Arabic. Is that correct?

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:26.390
Yeah, it's funny, you know in an organization as big as the CIA

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:33.910
Yeah, I was the only person who spoke both Greek and Arabic and then that sort of sets you up for

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:36.870
An assignment that they wanted to put you on that's right

