Now when in the world am I going to have to jump out of the back of the plane? I'm going to be making my recruitments

00:05:57.510 --> 00:05:59.510
diplomatic cocktail parties

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:03.190
Right, right and then what four years later

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:09.350
I'm in a plane over Afghanistan and I'm thinking I can't believe I have to jump out of the back of this plane

