At picking up a lot of a lot of the tradecraft that they teach you at the at the agency

00:06:24.790 --> 00:06:29.910
You know, it's funny. I've given thousands of interviews and you're the first person to ask me that and and that's a really

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:31.590
Good question

