That nobody would read my boss said to me

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:45.830
You know, you would be a really good operations officer and I was like what what are you talking about?

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.070
and he said

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:53.510
People like to be around you. You're you're fun and I said, well, thank you and I kind of just dismissed it

