00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:50.470
So I went up to the seventh floor of the cia. That's the executive level. There was a very very senior cia officer

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:57.510
For whom I had worked a decade earlier in the middle east and I knocked on his door and I said, hey, I need some advice

