00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:09.830
They can use whatever euphemism they want, but this is a torture program

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:15.990
Secondly, torture is a slippery slope and you know how these guys are somebody's going to go overboard

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:20.150
