00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:24.390
And then there's going to be a justice department investigation and somebody's going to go to prison

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:27.750
Do you want to go to prison? And I said, no, I don't want to go to prison

00:10:28.310 --> 00:10:32.950
As you mentioned in your intro, I was the only one who went to prison in the end

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:35.110
But I said, no, I don't want to go to prison

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:39.350
I went back downstairs to the counterterrorism center and I said, this is a torture program

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:43.830
I have a moral and ethical problem with it and I don't want anything to do with it and

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:48.870
As it turned out and this is one of the sources of great disappointment for me

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:55.030
