00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:07.670
Were friends we would hang out with each other and barbecue and

00:11:08.470 --> 00:11:12.470
I just I didn't realize until that day that they had it in their hearts to

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:19.190
You know to torture and in several cases to kill another human being in cold blood

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:21.350
But they did

00:11:21.350 --> 00:11:27.190
So, uh, you know after that decision despite the fact that I had captured up as beta

