I yeah, but I do missing a nuance

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:19.430
Okay. Yeah, so I was going to ask you to explain that on the surface explain the dichotomy of that statement. Yes

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:24.950
So we started torturing up as a beta on august 1st of 2002

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:29.510
Um, I said that I had an ethical and moral problem with it

