And and this is what I think most people missed

00:12:45.350 --> 00:12:48.470
I thought that there were two sides to this number one. It was wrong

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:51.110
But number two did it work

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:55.030
And the reporting we were getting back from the field was saying that it worked

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:58.790
That turned out to be a lie and we didn't know it was a lie

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:02.710
Until the inspector general released his report in 2009

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:06.390
What happened was the cia and the fbi

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:09.030
Had non-compatible

