00:13:21.990 --> 00:13:27.830
Now the fbi is really really good at interrogations and they've been good at interrogations

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:30.870
Since the nuremberg trials in 1946

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:39.110
So ali is reporting back what abu zubeda is telling him and that information is not making it into cia channels

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:43.830
So then the cia demands that they take over on august 1st

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:48.390
They do take over they began torturing him and he goes completely silent

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:50.950
But in order to justify the program

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:53.110
the two

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:55.110
torturers to contract

00:13:55.510 --> 00:13:59.350
Psychologists michael and jesson take ali sufan's information

