And type it into the cia system

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:10.390
Saying we're doing the program and he's given us the kitchen sink. Here it is and I said to one of the guys

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:15.270
You know, maybe i'm wrong about this. I mean, I still think that it's morally bankrupt

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:19.270
But in terms of getting the information, maybe i'm just wrong

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:22.470
Well, it turned out that no i wasn't wrong

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:26.870
They were lying about it from the very beginning and not just lying

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:32.950
You know to the policymakers, they were lying internally at the cia and being paid

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:36.150
108 million dollars for the contract by the way

