And right and so that's which is a very specific one. So at from initially there were there were a few different counts

00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:11.270
But the government settled on that particular one. Why did they do that? Oh, yeah

00:15:11.830 --> 00:15:17.910
So, uh, when I was arrested on the day of my arrest, this was the first week of january 2012

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:21.990
They charged me with five felonies three counts of espionage

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:28.950
One count of violating the intelligence identities protection act of 1982 and one count of making a false statement

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.270
um

00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:33.270
I hadn't committed espionage

00:15:33.270 --> 00:15:35.270
They knew I hadn't committed espionage

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:39.590
But on the day of my arrest they came to my lawyers and they said

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:42.230
take a plea

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:43.910
45 years

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:46.230
And he might live to meet his grandchildren

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:51.030
And we just dismissed it outright. I'm not going to take a plea and serve 45 years

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:55.910
They came back a couple of weeks later on a monday and they offered me 10 years

00:15:56.470 --> 00:16:00.230
Take the plea to espionage and do 10 years and I said

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:06.310
Talking to abc news is not espionage having lunch with the new york times is not espionage

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:10.950
It is on the other hand illegal to classify a crime

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:15.270
You know, if if the cia is doing something illegal

00:16:15.590 --> 00:16:20.150
It's actually illegal to classify it in order to keep the information from the public

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.790
So I said i'm not doing 10 minutes

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:27.510
So that was a monday on wednesday. They came back with eight years and on

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:31.830
Friday, they came back with five years and my lead attorney

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:38.070
I had 11 attorneys and this was an a-list dream team of white power defense attorneys

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:40.630
Most of whom were volunteers pro bono

00:16:41.990 --> 00:16:43.990
so

