And I said, what do you mean? He said usually they'll come and say

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:05.030
The offer is 10 years you turn it down and the next offer is 12 or 15 and the next offer is 18

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:09.110
But they're coming down 45 to 10 to 8 to 5

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:14.470
And I said, why are they doing that and he said because they have a shit case and they know it's shit

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:17.030
We're going to trial

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:18.310
so

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:20.310
We didn't hear from them again for

00:17:21.110 --> 00:17:22.310
wow

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:24.310
eight months, I suppose

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:26.870
and then finally they said

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:28.950
um

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:34.470
That they would drop all the charges except the intelligence identities protection act

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:39.430
And I would do three years and I turned that down

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:42.870
And then they came back and said best in final offer

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:47.030
two and a half years. I do 23 months and

00:17:48.070 --> 00:17:50.950
They gave me 24 hours to think about it. My wife and I

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:53.990
stayed up literally all night

