And the author of that act a guy named

00:18:04.870 --> 00:18:06.470
Morton Halperin

00:18:06.470 --> 00:18:13.510
Was part of my defense team. He was he wrote the law and he said that I should never have been charged with a crime in the first place

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:16.230
and um

00:18:16.230 --> 00:18:18.230
And I had an op-ed

00:18:18.310 --> 00:18:24.390
Written by joe biden saying that the law was unconstitutional on its face and should never have been passed

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:26.870
So

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:29.030
We decided that I was going to turn it down

